{
  "id": "ss.relic.venom",
  "name": "Septic acid",
  "description": "A drop of something gone bad landing on a plate of carapace, and the same fluid already coming out the underside of it: a green stain eating into the top face, and beneath the slab a swell of it welling through with two beads falling away. There is no hole drawn. A hole was the first idea — the ability is a wound that keeps getting worse — but a dark centre ringed in a bright colour is an eye whatever shape it is, and that is exactly how the first pass at ss.relic.oxygen failed. The plate not stopping it says the same thing without a pupil: what went in one side is out the other and still going. It also stays clear of ss.relic.might, the other green thing on the shelf — that one is a sac, a container of live fluid, and this is fluid that has left the container and is busy.",
